(7492578, 1193316, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, COLD scene, a tad too flat on the HDR maybe. Let me quibble with your title: "less" is a measure of *content* basically (there''s less wine in my glass) and "fewer" is a measure of number (you''ll take fewer winter photos in 2017). I know I''m being pedantic, and it''s not affecting my score. I like your picture :-)</td>', 'Nice shot, COLD scene, a tad too flat on the HDR maybe. Let me quibble with your title: "less" is a measure of *content* basically (there''s less wine in my glass) and "fewer" is a measure of number (you''ll take fewer winter photos in 2017). I know I''m being pedantic, and it''s not affecting my score. I like your picture :-)', '2017-01-17 00:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7492592, 1193310, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done -- Let''s work on it together! How did you avoid hot spots, or did you fix them in post?</td>', 'Nicely done -- Let''s work on it together! How did you avoid hot spots, or did you fix them in post?', '2017-01-17 09:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
