(7492594, 1193319, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and nice shot. Seems oversaturated...? It seems like the lights on the left take away from your subject too much.</td>', 'Love the idea and nice shot. Seems oversaturated...? It seems like the lights on the left take away from your subject too much.', '2017-01-17 09:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
