(7492894, 1193016, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club	<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Effective composition Susan, nice to see this different viewpoint but a challenging exposure for you no doubt. The exposure is way beyond any cameras latitude so its important to expose the way you have for the important detail. In fact the blown highlights and shadows add impact to the end result concentrating our focus where it should be. The soft focus and sepia tones also add a gentle appeal to the image. Good luck with your resolution, should be fun...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club	 An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Effective composition Susan, nice to see this different viewpoint but a challenging exposure for you no doubt. The exposure is way beyond any cameras latitude so its important to expose the way you have for the important detail. In fact the blown highlights and shadows add impact to the end result concentrating our focus where it should be. The soft focus and sepia tones also add a gentle appeal to the image. Good luck with your resolution, should be fun...', '2017-01-18 12:04:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492895, 1193199, 98339, '<td valign="top">Sweet...love the shine!!!</td>', 'Sweet...love the shine!!!', '2017-01-18 12:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492896, 1193018, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club	<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Wow, thats some view! The distant haze with its receding tones adds impact to the image. I didn''t notice the burning in at first but once seen it becomes more evident, you should have kept quiet I might not have noticed it! There is good detail throughout and blue tones really enhance the end result. What I do like are the sunlit patches particularly the one on the right with its wispy trees its gorgeous, the lighting throughout is very appealing. Enjoy your mountains Jonathon.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club	 An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Wow, thats some view! The distant haze with its receding tones adds impact to the image. I didn''t notice the burning in at first but once seen it becomes more evident, you should have kept quiet I might not have noticed it! There is good detail throughout and blue tones really enhance the end result. What I do like are the sunlit patches particularly the one on the right with its wispy trees its gorgeous, the lighting throughout is very appealing. Enjoy your mountains Jonathon.', '2017-01-18 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492898, 1192532, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club	<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Indeed Dave who could resist such temptation! Well done for bringing a welcome smile to so many people with your humorous take. Such a lovely looking cake but your pose is what completes the image,, nicely done. The lighting is a little on the harsh side with some loss of detail in the whites particularly on the left and the direction is rather flat on your face a bit more direction and angle would have improved it. I think your gonna need a lot of resolve to resist your wife''s lovely cooking, good luck</td>', 'Hello from the critique club	 An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Indeed Dave who could resist such temptation! Well done for bringing a welcome smile to so many people with your humorous take. Such a lovely looking cake but your pose is what completes the image,, nicely done. The lighting is a little on the harsh side with some loss of detail in the whites particularly on the left and the direction is rather flat on your face a bit more direction and angle would have improved it. I think your gonna need a lot of resolve to resist your wife''s lovely cooking, good luck', '2017-01-18 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492906, 1193316, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club	<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Well you''ve certainly appealed to your voters with this winter scene, I can understand why but its not really doing it for me, the snow on the lens detracts too much. The scene and composition and wood detail is good but the lighting is making the scene very flat and uninteresting. I''m really pleased for you that I am in the minority and that it has scored and placed so well.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club	 An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Well you''ve certainly appealed to your voters with this winter scene, I can understand why but its not really doing it for me, the snow on the lens detracts too much. The scene and composition and wood detail is good but the lighting is making the scene very flat and uninteresting. I''m really pleased for you that I am in the minority and that it has scored and placed so well.', '2017-01-18 13:38:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7492908, 1192891, 98565, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=163081" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GeorgesBogaert</a> wrote:<br/> <br/>I think this picture should have scored much higher. <br/>I gave it a 7. The background colour is somehow unappealing. I would have changed some tones to lean more to blue.</td>', ' GeorgesBogaert wrote: I think this picture should have scored much higher. I gave it a 7. The background colour is somehow unappealing. I would have changed some tones to lean more to blue.', '2017-01-18 14:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
