(7493070, 1192891, 24983, '<td valign="top">I think it is an exposure problem the image looks a litle flat,play around a little with PS .play around with your camera controls also.<br/> <br/>photography is about experementing and we learn heaps from our mistakes, However it was a bold entry and good on you for participating. Keep on taking photos, look at the work of other photographers you are always learning about this hobby of ours</td>', 'I think it is an exposure problem the image looks a litle flat,play around a little with PS .play around with your camera controls also. photography is about experementing and we learn heaps from our mistakes, However it was a bold entry and good on you for participating. Keep on taking photos, look at the work of other photographers you are always learning about this hobby of ours', '2017-01-19 02:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7493089, 1192891, 124815, '<td valign="top">The challenge was standard editing. You could have played a bit with color and saturation. I gave it 5 because I liked the explosion of what looked like ribbons, but the brownish background put me off.</td>', 'The challenge was standard editing. You could have played a bit with color and saturation. I gave it 5 because I liked the explosion of what looked like ribbons, but the brownish background put me off.', '2017-01-19 10:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
