(7493881, 1193236, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the HM, Wendy!  Curious to know, what were your settings?  I get wing blur at even 1/3200 on fast little birds. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I set the ISO to 1250 (f4) so I got 1/4000 of a second on this. I had to do a lot of denoising!</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Congrats on the HM, Wendy!  Curious to know, what were your settings?  I get wing blur at even 1/3200 on fast little birds.   I set the ISO to 1250 (f4) so I got 1/4000 of a second on this. I had to do a lot of denoising!', '2017-01-22 20:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
